  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Translating the SDG Framework in BIH into Sustainable and Inclusive Growth, UNDP - Translating the SDG Framework in BIH into Sustainable and Inclusive Growth</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xd6;vers&#xe4;tta SDG Framework i BIH till h&#xe5;llbar och inkluderande tillv&#xe4;xt, UNDP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet syftar till att st&#xf6;dja regeringarna i BIH i deras anstr&#xe4;ngningar att uppn&#xe5; sina m&#xe5;l f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar utveckling som &#xf6;verenskommits i SDG Framework i BIH genom att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra styrsystemet, fr&#xe4;mja smart tillv&#xe4;xt och i slut&#xe4;ndan bidra till att skapa ett samh&#xe4;lle med lika m&#xf6;jligheter. M&#xe5;let kommer att efterstr&#xe4;vas genom tre sammanl&#xe4;nkade och &#xf6;msesidigt f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkande resultat som genomf&#xf6;rs p&#xe5; alla niv&#xe5;er av regeringar i BIH.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to supporting the governments in BIH in their efforts to achieve their sustainable development targets agreed in the SDG Framework in BIH by improving the governance system, fostering smart growth, and ultimately contributing to creating society of equal opportunities. The aim will be pursued through three interlinked and mutually reinforcing results implemented across all levels of governments in BIH.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the program aims to contribute to accelerated achievements of Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) through supporting governance systems and private sector engagement towards green, sustainable and inclusive growth. 

The Project is based on implementation of two outcomes and respective outputs: 

Outcome 1: Authorities at state, entity and Brcko District levels effectively work on planning, implementing, monitoring and reporting on the SDG Framework in BIH as well as fostering development partnerships

Outcome 2: Cantonal and local governments actively contribute to implementation of the SDG Framework in BIH. 

In summary, the programme will provide required support to the authorities in Bosnia and Herzegovina in their activities and progress towards the Sustainable Development Goals as per targets defined in the SDG Framework in Bosnia and Herzegovina. Actions will be interlinked and reinforced engaging all levels of government in BIH, relevant for planning, monitoring and reporting. Further, the activities will be coupled with active participation and contribution of the cantonal and local governments and private sector aimed at implementing SDG Framework.</narrative>
  </description>
